Kalau luncuran secepat itu langsung

5
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:09,681
menyapu sungai,

6
00:00:09,681 --> 00:00:11,696
dasar tanah tergerus dalam hingga

7
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:12,801
