8
00:00:13,084 --> 00:00:14,867
Fisika serupa tampak saat air

9
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:16,459
keran jatuh ke piring lalu

10
00:00:16,459 --> 00:00:18,187
membentuk cincin air tebal yang

11
00:00:18,187 --> 00:00:18,736
